+- 2026-10-01: GPT Sol plan review ([prompt](261001c-quiz-profile-and-goal-plan-review-prompt.md),
+  [answer](261001c-quiz-profile-and-goal-plan-review-sol.md); exit 0, file fresh). *Revise before
